WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:13.830 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  welcome to sugar lab we're in the arts  district in downtown los angeles i'm  kyle von hassling i'm meegan bozeman i'm  william hoo and we're co-founders of  sugar lab and we create 3d printed food  experiences we created sugar lab over 10  years ago when we invented a new kind of  3d printer that prints with dehydrated  food powders it's been our brainchild  since then our labor of love and we're  proud to share it now we 3d print with  real food everything that we print with  is something this chef would source and  it's all edible and safe to eat 3d  printing with food is incredible because  it does a couple things really really  well it creates food in incredible  precision we 3d print with a lot of  geometric corners and symmetry that  aren't able to be done by hand you can  do things with 3d printed food that  complement traditional but also do  things that are not even possible one of  the challenges with 3d printed food is  that people have never had it before  it's been a fun challenge to figure out  what we should offer to people all right  now let's go upstairs to check out the  design process  so this is the strawberry bonbon we  sketched it out first and now i'm just  roughing out the shape of it and then  now i'm going to start placing the seeds  and we can do this really precisely on  the software we love that our food can  look like the actual food that we're  designing and also we can play off that  by changing the whole experience of  actually eating that fruit and that's  important to us because this is already  a new product and we wanted to make it  super familiar but also change that  experience which people won't really  expecting and now we have a kitchen out  here where chef victoria does her magic  hi my name is victoria rose johnson i am  the kitchen manager and resident pastry  chef here i have so much fun i get to  make incredible things and beautiful  things of that when i was younger i used  to love bacon cakes and that led to me  going to the culinary institute of  america i landed here and now this is  what i get to do  i have always been interested in the  decorating aspect and there are  limitations when it comes to making  things out of fondant and buttercream  but there are no limitations here and  it's absolutely amazing one of my  favorites is our love and hex potions  these are glitter bombs which are  absolutely amazing the process for  printing it absolutely has to begin with  measuring out all of your ingredients  what i'm about to make is our kimchi  bouillon one of our savory items that we  make i'm going to start with our neutral  powder this is the one that doesn't have  any additional flavor it basically  tastes very similar to powdered sugar  next i know this looks exactly the same  but it is actually our lime powder one  of my favorite parts is our beautiful  beautiful gochugaru we have to make it  super super fine so that there's no  chance that the particle size is too big  it could fail a print if the particle  size were too big or it wouldn't spread  right in the printer which of course  is no fun for anybody next here i have  the celery salt that helps bring in that  green flavor that you you aren't going  to get with powdered sugar and then last  but not least is our regular salt again  refined super super fine all of those  get mixed into a big bowl that then gets  brought over to the printer when we're  ready to sift into the printer i start  by finding the correct file on the  little computer that's attached to the  printer i make sure i heighten the feed  in the build bed now the feed bed is  where the powder is going to go before  it starts printing and the build bed is  where the powder is going to end up it  moves from one to the other and that's  that's basically part of the printing  process so i will pull it up right here  and i will get these to their right  heights and then we're ready to go it is  a weird feeling that most of my job as a  chef is playing with technology and yes  it is always this messy after i have  everything sifted in i gotta make sure  that all those little loose particles  that got around the edges get into the  print itself now we gotta grab the  tamper i like doing the little tap at  the end to get all of the excess off now  we're going to have to smooth this guy  out so let's bring these up to the right  height this is going to pull the powder  across and make that really nice flat  top so that we have a good printing base  and of course while the base itself is a  sugar mixture it gets bound with a  water-based ink similar to how you would  use food coloring and other things and  there she is flat beautiful and ready  for printing  when i go to excavate i essentially push  down the feed bed which is where the  powder came from and i push up the build  bed just a little bit so i have access  to the parts next i just grab them so we  of course really really carefully pull  them out and we set them up on these  little trays here so this blue is going  to come out really really gorgeous when  we do powder which is a fun little  machine it's extremely loud which is  really convenient for singing songs when  i'm alone in the kitchen  it is not however convenient when i'm  singing songs really loud in the kitchen  and don't hear my co-workers walk  through the door  they're all ready to go after that these  have a nice neutral flavor and they are  blue toned it's not the only color that  we do we also do an orange ombre as well  as some other beautiful rainbow cubes  these are most commonly used in tea or  coffee anything you want just a little  bit sweeter neutral is not the only  flavor we make we also do things like  watermelon lemonade and lime we do  things as crazy as mexican hot chocolate  and cinnamon  not as sweet as i thought it would be  which is really nice i think it's like a  refreshing level of sweetness  so these are the strawberry covered  chocolate truffles they have an  incredible ginger shell the red one is  filled with a caramelized honey and  chili then we also have the pink one  here which is a tamarind elderflower and  then the last one here is our white one  and it is a pineapple upside down cake  these are some of my favorites they're  the original recipes that we made very  very very beginning i am getting ready  to fill here i've got my ganache i've  got my little truffles over here we make  a ton of different truffles the flavor i  have here is tamarind elderflower all of  the ganache gets made in-house each one  of these is hand filled by me cheers  mmm  you guys have to try this the shell  every time i think it's gonna break my  teeth it doesn't it's so soft got the  perfect bite oddly enough our best  seller is one of our savory items that  we make and it is our kimchi bouillon  which is an absolutely wonderful recipe  that we make that ends up tasting like  kimchi and you can put it in your ramen  there's a million different things you  can do with it so it's both surprising  and not surprising that it's our top  seller  it tastes like  elevated cup noodles there's so many  great memories over the course of the  last decade with sugar lab we've had a  ton of really special projects that came  to us from excited chefs who want to  make something super custom or even just  from people all across the country or  who are hosting birthday parties get  togethers we have a custom wedding line  we also make cake toppers for weddings  and they're super cool we work with  bakers locally here in la one of the  really neat things we can do is 3d scan  a bride or groom and render them in 3d  and then 3d print it directly into sugar  and you have your own likeness in the 3d  printed sugar it's made from our friends  over at action face they have an iphone  app you download it and 3d scan yourself  and then send us the file and we get it  3d printed speaking of figurines we made  one of you jasmine oh my gosh  it's me  this is the coolest thing i've ever seen  let's eat it cheers  [Music]  mmm  it tastes like cake with the texture of  meringue this is crazy all that hard  work the printer did and i'm just eating  it this is the neutral one so it tastes  like sugar and it's really nicely  flavored at the end of the day we all  love food and we wanted 3d printed food  to be a part of everyone's life  [Music]  [Music]  you

